0..75 Comment "// This source drives an endpoint through a recursive protocol with a loop."
76..105 Comment "// Such a loop need not exit."
106..175 Comment "// Its passes are the steps of a demonic iteration over the protocol."
176..178 Comment "//"
179..225 Comment "// Each loop turn completes one protocol pass."
226..262 Comment "// One fixpoint supplies the passes."
263..324 Comment "// An outer binding would capture the endpoint in every pass."
325..384 Comment "// The loop threads the endpoint as it threads a held slot."
385..436 Comment "// A pass acts on its endpoint before it continues."
437..439 Comment "//"
440..493 Comment "// The lowering gives the endpoint to the first pass."
494..536 Comment "// The loop head holds the starting state."
537..586 Comment "// `continue` returns the endpoint at that state."
587..623 Comment "// Such a loop follows its protocol."
624..657 Comment "// Such a loop owes no `Partial`."
658..660 Comment "//"
661..676 Comment "// - see: #4502"
677..692 Comment "// - see: #4705"
693..708 Comment "// - see: #4727"
